---
source: crates/keyvo-cli/tests/doctor.rs
expression: text
---
ok    keypad   the Keypad is [root]/dev/hidraw2, readable and writable
ok    uinput   [root]/dev/uinput is writable, chord keys can type
ok    rule     [root]/etc/udev/rules.d/70-keyvo.rules is the shipped rule
ok    session  a KDE Plasma session on Wayland
ok    focus    KWin's focus stealing prevention is Low (1)
ok    unit     the user unit keyvo-daemon is active
ok    daemon   keyvo-daemon 0.0.0 answers on [root]/run/keyvo/keyvo.sock, the Keypad is connected
warn  solaar   Solaar runs (Flatpak io.github.pwr_solaar.solaar): it must set no divert on the Creative Console devices, they conflict with keyvo's own
      fix: flatpak kill io.github.pwr_solaar.solaar
ok    flatpak  the app io.github.qubernetic.keyvo is installed
